  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/762/banner-png.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>⚠注意：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將僅透過CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft上的devHeycronus帳號正式發布和維護。</strong></p><p><strong>瑪利歐礦車 🏎️✨</strong></p><p>為您的Minecraft體驗增添有趣變化，使用<strong>瑪利歐礦車</strong>材質！現在，您的礦車將變身為<strong>瑪利歐賽車</strong>中瑪利歐的經典賽車。🚗💨 在賽道上馳騁，感受賽車的刺激！🌟🏁</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>🔧&nbsp;<strong>重要提示：</strong>需要<strong>OptiFine</strong>才能正常運作！🔥</p><p>準備好體驗一場充滿樂趣與懷舊的旅程吧！🎮✨</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></p>",
